#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to gmmlib"
msgstr "Introdução ao gmmlib"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/intel-gmmlib.xml:28
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>gmmlib</application> package contains the Intel Graphics "
"Memory Management Library, which provides device specific memory and buffer "
"management functions for the Intel Media Driver for VAAPI and the Intel "
"Graphics Computer Runtime for OpenCL (TM)."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>gmmlib</application> contém a biblioteca Graphics "
"Memory Management da Intel, que fornece memória específica do dispositivo e "
"funções de gerenciamento de buffer para o Intel Media Driver para VAAPI e "
"para o Intel Graphics Computer Runtime para OpenCL (TM)."

